      en: ["The official grand opening took place on September 24, 2008, with a massive fireworks display.", "The resort features 1,544 rooms divided between two main towers connected by a bridge.", "The Lost Chambers Aquarium is home to approximately 65,000 marine animals.", "Construction of the Palm Jumeirah island required 94 million cubic meters of sand.", "Aquaventure is one of the largest and most visited waterparks in the Middle East.", "The total construction cost of the resort reached approximately 1.5 billion US dollars."],
      es: ["El hotel cuenta con 1.544 habitaciones y suites.", "Inauguración el 24 de septiembre de 2008.", "Los costes de construcción fueron de unos 1.500 millones de dólares.", "Aquaventure se extiende sobre 17 hectáreas.", "El acuario Lost Chambers contiene más de 65.000 animales marinos.", "La temperatura del agua en el acuario se mantiene a 24°C."],
